# Chokepoint environment variables.
#
# Phase 0/1 constraint (§6.2, §16.1): the project runs in fixture mode with
# NO credentials. No provider keys are read anywhere in the Phase 0/1 code.
#
# When a live source is admitted in a later phase (after the §6.1 admission
# gate), its key is added here, kept server-side only (§14.1), and this file
# documents the variable name only — never a real value.

# Example (Phase 2+, unset — placeholder only):
# AISSTREAM_API_KEY=
